{"4975060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nav Singh's Stranded", "steam_appid": 4975060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded is a 4-12 player  horror survival game where you and your friends are survivors stranded on a cursed island. An evil entity known as the &quot;dark stalker&quot; approaches players, offering them life in exchange for killing another survivor.</strong>       <br><strong> </strong><br><u>HOW TO PLAY </u><br> <br>The rules of the game are straightforward. <br> <br>There is 1 engineer, while everyone else is a survivor. The engineer must find and repair the radio tower to signal for help.  <br> <br>Repair parts are scattered across the island and must be handed to the engineer, as they are the only one that can fix the broken tower. <br> <br><strong>There are 3 ways to win</strong>: Find and Repair the Radio Tower, Find and Fire the Flare Gun (instant win), or Escape on an Abandoned Ship with only 2-3 members of your crew. <br> <br><u>THE DARK STALKER </u><br>  <br>The island is haunted by an evil spirit known as the “dark stalker”. The stalker approaches players individually as they explore the island. Players have two choices: Work with the stalker to kill a fellow survivor, or sacrifice themselves instead.  <br>  <br>If they choose to work with the stalker, they can continue to help their team once the deal is complete.  <br>  <br><u>SURVIVAL </u> <br>  <br>The game features three survival mechanics: Warmth, Hunger, and Sleep. Players must ensure these stats do not run out at any point in the game, or they die.  <br>  <br>To refill warmth, keep the central campfire lit. Warmth goes down as you drift away from the campfire.  <br>  <br>To refill hunger, eat berries found in bushes around the island. Just keep in mind that a small percentage of these berries are poisonous and cause instant death.  <br>  <br>To refill sleep, press Z at any time. The only catch is that you cannot see anything while you are sleeping.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded is a 4-12 player  horror survival game where you and your friends are survivors stranded on a cursed island. An evil entity known as the &quot;dark stalker&quot; approaches players, offering them life in exchange for killing another survivor.</strong>       <br><strong> </strong><br><u>HOW TO PLAY </u><br> <br>The rules of the game are straightforward. <br> <br>There is 1 engineer, while everyone else is a survivor. The engineer must find and repair the radio tower to signal for help.  <br> <br>Repair parts are scattered across the island and must be handed to the engineer, as they are the only one that can fix the broken tower. <br> <br><strong>There are 3 ways to win</strong>: Find and Repair the Radio Tower, Find and Fire the Flare Gun (instant win), or Escape on an Abandoned Ship with only 2-3 members of your crew. <br> <br><u>THE DARK STALKER </u><br>  <br>The island is haunted by an evil spirit known as the “dark stalker”. The stalker approaches players individually as they explore the island. Players have two choices: Work with the stalker to kill a fellow survivor, or sacrifice themselves instead.  <br>  <br>If they choose to work with the stalker, they can continue to help their team once the deal is complete.  <br>  <br><u>SURVIVAL </u> <br>  <br>The game features three survival mechanics: Warmth, Hunger, and Sleep. Players must ensure these stats do not run out at any point in the game, or they die.  <br>  <br>To refill warmth, keep the central campfire lit. Warmth goes down as you drift away from the campfire.  <br>  <br>To refill hunger, eat berries found in bushes around the island. Just keep in mind that a small percentage of these berries are poisonous and cause instant death.  <br>  <br>To refill sleep, press Z at any time. The only catch is that you cannot see anything while you are sleeping.</p>", "short_description": "St